WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:29.211
"I have some news," said Mr. Grill.

2
00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:32.393
"I'm forming a racing team."

3
00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:34.847
"What?" cried Eddy.

4
00:00:34.848 --> 00:00:37.636
"Really?" said Zippy.

5
00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:42.877
"Tryouts are next week," said Mr. Grill.

6
00:00:42.878 --> 00:00:47.210
"I'll pick the fastest cars.

7
00:00:47.211 --> 00:00:50.052
They'll get team stickers."

8
00:00:50.053 --> 00:00:53.867
"Oh boy!" said Eddy.

9
00:00:53.868 --> 00:01:05.077
"I hope I make the team."

10
00:01:05.078 --> 00:01:08.359
"You will," said Poppy.

11
00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:12.515
"You're fast," said Jeb.

12
00:01:12.516 --> 00:01:23.543
"We'll help you train," said Dipper.

13
00:01:23.544 --> 00:01:43.096
Eddy trained all week.

14
00:01:43.097 --> 00:01:50.354
He drove faster each day.

15
00:01:50.355 --> 00:01:58.011
His friends cheered him on.

16
00:01:58.012 --> 00:02:06.506
"Go, Eddy!" said Jeb.

17
00:02:06.507 --> 00:02:09.679
Zippy flew by Eddy.

18
00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:13.003
"Ha-ha!" said Zippy.

19
00:02:13.004 --> 00:02:36.232
"Eddy won't make the team!"

20
00:02:36.233 --> 00:02:39.619
Eddy stopped.

21
00:02:39.620 --> 00:02:43.180
"Don't listen to Zippy," said Poppy.

22
00:02:43.181 --> 00:02:45.636
"You'll make the team."

23
00:02:45.637 --> 00:02:49.119
Eddy sighed.

24
00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:54.239
"I hope you're right."
